G-xsh5x-rBzN1XL37fswS0vW8p3Xcm7RbGytW1Sc6lw99DfYYW8pyq995Pmw5BW3PjvJb4NCZy1=
W1DlRln4HlkvLW7bYGFw1sRY9bW6L0dgk52sdTkW5FfMdq4FfJZLW1TJHh05gdVjCW5BZt_z3D7=
7QFf1Bw5sH04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id=
-v2=3D"J2PCPbLG" target=3D"_blank">~70%</a> of Fortune 500 companies having=
 adopted hybrid models.&nbsp;<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">As such, demand for coworking spaces is once =
again booming.&nbsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">Coworking space in the US totaled <a href=3D"https://d=
2q-Vf04.na1.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VXbcLk5yN7rRW4C5z2S8BfNJ8W=
7lBRbf5K86t_N1xVmZM2_3wqW7Y8-PT6lZ3p5W5Wlwgs6wncDVW4S2_wV6NMWZ6W2-SnYm1qbrs=
