HmZUkAi" target=3D"_blank">159m</a> square feet by the end of 2025, accordi=
ng to Coworking Cafe, up 17% YoY and ~38% over the past three years.<br><br=
></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">While it accounts for just 2.2% of total US office inv=
entory, analysts <a href=3D"https://d2q-Vf04.na1.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/UB+11=
3/d2q-Vf04/VXbcLk5yN7rRW4C5z2S8BfNJ8W7lBRbf5K86t_N1xVmYz4ZD0CW5BWr2F6lZ3nKW=
2vTJKM6mP-XJW7gG_mz6197YqW4gyBX-7M8MtLW8fqZRL2yxQhWW188Yyv7BgsYmVD4tnM5DLNK=
zW3y_1874WnHF8W2ywqq-5jcppnW93Mw0v6fSl4LW5qz01F8WHjjkW7bHwJ56fvCngW701wTK2p=
