rget=3D"_blank">expect</a> that figure could eventually grow to 10%.</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">But this time around, a growing share of that=
 floorspace is being taken up by coworking companies that are elevating wha=
t labor looks like=E2=80=A6 &nbsp; <br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold; font-size: =
18px;">Enter: The era of luxury coworking</span><br><br>For remote workers =
who can afford it and companies that want offices without a long-term lease=
, these next-gen spaces offer premium amenities and stunning interiors =E2=
=80=94 divided into shared spaces, meeting rooms, and private offices =E2=
=80=94 that turn work into a lifestyle.&nbsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">At <a href=3D"https://d2q-Vf04.na1.hubspotlinks.com/Ct=
c/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VXbcLk5yN7rRW4C5z2S8BfNJ8W7lBRbf5K86t_N1xVm-l2_3wqW95jsWP=
